OL,3,GNEWSABeach oil clean-up will take
OL,4,A'several days'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMike Humber, the council's director for
OL,7,Fthe environment, said the operation
OL,8,Fwould "take several days" but could not
OL,9,Fprovide a timescale for reopening.
